# mediuming.py's driver (Sky Temple Grounds area 46: Ings u0417 u0454, tentacles u0491..u049b).
# Without the slice-2 states mC1 stays set; `var <id> ming.c1 0` clears it (what SubStart does),
# `ming.extend` / `ming.retract` do ArmAttack's tentacle calls (PortCMediumIng.cpp).
@f300 god 1; tp 208.5 -174 -46.5; face 180
@f340 status; obj u0417
@f360 screenshot
@f380 var u0417 ming.c1 0; var u0454 ming.c1 0
@f430 obj u0417; screenshot
@f440 visor scan
@f460 screenshot
@f470 visor combat
@f480 noise 6; noise 4
@f500 shoot u0417
@f530 shoot u0417 charged
@f570 place u0417 player 1
@f600 send u0491 Activate; place u0491 player 10; send u0492 Activate; place u0492 player 12
@f620 var u0491 ming.extend 1; var u0492 ming.extend 1
@f630 screenshot; obj u0491
@f700 var u0491 ming.retract 1; var u0492 ming.retract 1
@f720 screenshot
@f800 var u0491 ming.retract; obj u0491; place u0417 player 8; damage u0417 999
@f840 obj u0417; screenshot
@f900 status; objs ing
